		(property "Description" "Auto-run sink, NVM holds the PDOs. CCxDB to CCx: dead battery mode, the probe is unpowered when the cable arrives. VDD from VBUS, VSYS from +3V3: I2C5 (shared with the INA226) is not clamped low when USB is absent. RESET grounded (soft reset over I2C), address 0x28. ALERT: MCU pull-up on PG0"
